        {
          "label": "C",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
        },
        {
          "label": "E",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
        }
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "answer": {
        "correct": null,
        "solution_html": null,
        "model": {
          "answer": "D",
          "by": "sonnet",
          "agrees": null,
          "solution_html": "<p>Pole trójkąta równobocznego o boku s: (√3/4)s².</p><p>Suma pól = (√3/4)(3²+(√7)²) = (√3/4)(9+7) = 4√3.</p><p>1/4 sumy = √3.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
